      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استرزقهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked,</i> or <i>demanded, of him
what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِزْق</span> [i. e. <i>means of subsistence,</i> &amp;c.;
when said of a soldier, <i>subsistence-money, pay,</i> or
<i>allowance</i>]; (MA, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتزقهُ</span></b> . (TA.)

